{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_25", "source_id": "66091515000000001a011957", "title": "一年只分享一次！油痘肌博主爱用空瓶分享～", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66091515000000001a011957", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1776, "evidence_unit_count": 55, "original_evidence_unit_count": 55, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 221, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["然而不下了 一年只做一次的空瓶分享來嘍 我覺得如果一個護膚博主他能夠把一款產品用完", "但是其他的我可能伸手就扔掉了 這支眼霜的效果我覺得就是 我的眼周肌膚被他養得非常好", "接著呢 是這個唇部精華 我用了這個唇部精華之後 我就再也沒有", "它又可以兇護 又可以抗火火 還可以控油 夏天用它 超舒服", "很適合想要 但是又有點敏的膚質 不過短時間 我應該不會 再回購它了 因為它太精用了", "然而不下了 一年只做一次的空瓶分享來嘍 我覺得如果一個護膚博主他能夠把一款產品用完", "能夠讓我用完或者是用到第二瓶 就說明我真的是超愛 那我們馬上開始"], "retained_quotes": ["然而不下了 一年只做一次的空瓶分享來嘍 我覺得如果一個護膚博主他能夠把一款產品用完", "能夠讓我用完或者是用到第二瓶 就說明我真的是超愛 那我們馬上開始"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66091515000000001a011957/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66091515000000001a011957/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66091515000000001a011957/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66091515000000001a011957/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "c624079a9f99939294190768c6fc102a4101a8ee34b4289e8f13743afe1ba057", "card_hash": "4eb29d2999fa2211f52a7b2efd53bb1f94c6de568c286ceb2f53aa341081b98e", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"