{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_25", "source_id": "65f80ef60000000012021334", "title": "300元搞定痘肌平价早晚间护肤，皮肤好细腻！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f80ef60000000012021334", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1364, "evidence_unit_count": 40, "original_evidence_unit_count": 40, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 126, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["我會一直就是不斷地就是這樣加水 就是我在它的主頁裡面 大概看它推薦的可能有100次", "紅紅紅火火給壓下去 而且當我們的皮膚就是那個油脂線 在那麼大量的出油的時候呢", "然後疏透毛孔 改善我們臉上的這些豆豆鼻孔 這一瓶其實我是被茶裡重草的", "後敷到這裡已經有臉部了嘛 但是我現在臉就是還是 非常非常清爽的", "就是用這個水 然後再加上 清爽部門豆的面霜或者乳液 再加一個防曬就ok了 那我去睡覺啦 晚安", "但是我也很願意把這套評價的護膚品帶著跑 因為它們是中度跟度很好用", "先用這個菌菇水 這個水我覺得它就是區別於那種 普通的只能補水保濕的手複水"], "retained_quotes": ["但是我也很願意把這套評價的護膚品帶著跑 因為它們是中度跟度很好用", "先用這個菌菇水 這個水我覺得它就是區別於那種 普通的只能補水保濕的手複水"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f80ef60000000012021334/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f80ef60000000012021334/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f80ef60000000012021334/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f80ef60000000012021334/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "0eb5c114b8c05b18e6d4216ef2154f899c03542d6b6abf835369aaffa16e979a", "card_hash": "b09c9553af5695c8c6e10463dcf5b418bd516f9db6c0a8f15d990b5aaccb8e4f", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned