{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_25", "source_id": "65f3b739000000001203f625", "title": "油皮爱死了的平价防晒分享✨", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f3b739000000001203f625", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 913, "evidence_unit_count": 27, "original_evidence_unit_count": 27, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 69, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天这一期我想跟大家分享 三支咱们油皮用了会爱死了的评价防晒", "所以我基本上是把它当做一支保湿妆浅和防晒二和一来使用 用了它之后再去上底妆", "上脸之后可以很自然的体谅亮肤色 而且能修饰毛孔 有一种一件美颜模皮的感觉", "就可能不太合适了 然后是这一支我觉得有很多姐妹 应该都已经用过它了吧", "我一般会在秋冬春这三个季节用它 比较推荐给我干持和混油皮的姐妹", "所以我每次用完它之后 都感觉我的脸上像再上了一层 这种保湿乳液的感觉", "所以我基本上是把它当做一支保湿妆浅和防晒二和一来使用 用了它之后再去上底妆"], "retained_quotes": ["所以我每次用完它之后 都感觉我的脸上像再上了一层 这种保湿乳液的感觉", "所以我基本上是把它当做一支保湿妆浅和防晒二和一来使用 用了它之后再去上底妆"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f3b739000000001203f625/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f3b739000000001203f625/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f3b739000000001203f625/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65f3b739000000001203f625/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b05c03cf8d3eff2fd1cd3f7049c307ecf52140f89c159433319f35bcce76122d", "card_hash": "abdbbaf12009eb4196188c421c7fb98682fdab83024d869e5173949edb6d639f", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
